[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Well done, Travis.  "
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "You're now 25th."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "How does it feel to zip halfway"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "through the ranks?"
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "Feels good.  "
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "Quick and dirty's my style."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "Gotta admit, though. "
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "This does have a bad aftertaste."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "Ripping through a bunch of mostly"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "harmless cheerleaders?"
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "Well, "
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "I could nullify your victory."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "Whoa, whoa, wait!"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "I mean they weren't that harmless."
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "You can tear some shit up "
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "with a pompom."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "...Good answer."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "By the way, the UAA will now "
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "confiscate your robot. "
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "The hell you will!"
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "It is too big and it is "
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "a public nuisance."
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "You gotta be kiddin'...Man, I had"
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "this baby custom-made, too."
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "Travis."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "Don't forget you're not the only"
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "assassin clawing up the ranks."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "Being 25th means there are just "
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "as many below you as above, "
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "and they all want you dead. "
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "So watch your back, okay?"
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "Yeah, yeah."
  }
]